                    <div class="service-features">
                        <span class="feature-tag">24/7</span>
                        <span class="feature-tag">Gwarancja</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-glow"></div>
                <div class="floating-dots">
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card" data-service="2">
                <div class="service-icon">
                    <div class="icon-bg">
                        <span class="icon">📹</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h3>Inspekcja Kamerą</h3>
                    <p>Precyzyjna diagnoza problemów z rurami bez konieczności kucia ścian.</p>
                    <div class="service-features">
                        <span class="feature-tag">HD</span>
                        <span class="feature-tag">Raport</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-glow"></div>
                <div class="floating-dots">
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card" data-service="3">
                <div class="service-icon">
                    <div class="icon-bg">
                        <span class="icon">🚰</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h3>Udrażnianie Rur</h3>
                    <p>Szybkie i skuteczne usuwanie zatorów w kanalizacji i odpływach.</p>
                    <div class="service-features">
                        <span class="feature-tag">Ekologiczne</span>
                        <span class="feature-tag">Natychmiastowe</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-glow"></div>
                <div class="floating-dots">
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card" data-service="4">
                <div class="service-icon">
                    <div class="icon-bg">
                        <span class="icon">🏠</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h3>Instalacje Sanitarne</h3>
                    <p>Kompleksowe wykonanie instalacji wodno-kanalizacyjnych w nowych budynkach.</p>
                    <div class="service-features">
                        <span class="feature-tag">Projekt</span>
                        <span class="feature-tag">Normy</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-glow"></div>
                <div class="floating-dots">
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card" data-service="5">
                <div class="service-icon">
                    <div class="icon-bg">
                        <span class="icon">🔍</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h3>Lokalizacja Wycieków</h3>
                    <p>Profesjonalna detekcja nieszczelności bez niszczenia konstrukcji.</p>
                    <div class="service-features">
                        <span class="feature-tag">Laser</span>
                        <span class="feature-tag">Dokładność</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-glow"></div>
                <div class="floating-dots">
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card" data-service="6">
                <div class="service-icon">
                    <div class="icon-bg">
                        <span class="icon">🚨</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="service-content">
                    <h3>Pogotowie 24/7</h3>
                    <p>Awaria hydrauliczna? Jesteśmy dostępni całą dobę, także w weekendy.</p>
                    <div class="service-features">
                        <span class="feature-tag">15 min</span>
                        <span class="feature-tag">Mobilne</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-glow"></div>
                <div class="floating-dots">
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                    <div class="dot"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="services-cta">
            <div class="cta-content">
                <h3 class="gradient-text">Potrzebujesz pomocy hydraulicznej?</h3>
                <p>Zadzwoń do nas już teraz lub skorzystaj z naszego systemu AI</p>
                <div class="cta-buttons">
                    <a href="tel:511323123" class="btn-conic">Zadzwoń teraz</a>
                    <button class="btn-terminal" onclick="copyCommand()">
                        <span class="terminal-text">npx hydraulik-ai</span>
                        <span class="copy-icon">📋</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="trust-badges">
                <div class="badge">⭐ 4.9/5 Google Reviews</div>
                <div class="badge">🏆 Certyfikowani Fachowcy</div>
                <div class="badge">⚡ 15 min reakcja</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script>
// @ts-nocheck
function copyCommand() {
    const text = 'npx hydraulik-ai';
    navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(() => {
        const btn = document.querySelector('.btn-terminal');
        const original = btn.innerHTML;
        btn.innerHTML = '<span class="terminal-text">Skopiowano! ✅</span><span class="copy-icon">📋</span>';
        setTimeout(() => {
            btn.innerHTML = original;
        }, 2000);
    });
}

// Intersection Observer for reveal animations
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
        entries.forEach(entry => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                entry.target.classList.add('reveal');
            }
        });
    }, { threshold: 0.1 });

    document.querySelectorAll('.service-card').forEach(card => {
        observer.observe(card);
    });
});
</script>

<style>
.services-aura {
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    background: var(--bg-cream);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--text-dark);
}

.services-aura::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.12) 0%, transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(255, 111, 0, 0.08) 0%, transparent 45%);
    pointer-events: none;
}

.container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
}

.section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
}

.gradient-text {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    position: relative;
}

.section-header p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-gray);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}

.services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
}

.service-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.14);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
    cursor: pointer;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
}

.service-card.reveal {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
}

.service-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    border-color: rgba(255, 111, 0, 0.28);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.12);
}

.service-card:hover .card-glow {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1.3);
}

.service-icon {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.icon-bg {
    width: 80px;
    height: 80px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.18), rgba(255, 111, 0, 0.18));
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}

..icon-bg::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -50%;
    left: -50%;
    width: 200%;
    height: 200%;
    background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent, rgba(255, 111, 0, 0.25), rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.15), transparent);
}

.icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
}

.service-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.service-content p {
    color: var(--text-gray);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.service-features {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
}

.feature-tag {
    background: rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.09);
    color: var(--primary-dark);
    padding: 0.45rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: 1px solid rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.12);
}

.card-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
    width: 150px;
    height: 150px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 111, 0, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(0.8);
    transition: all 0.5s ease;
    z-index: 0;
}

.floating-dots {
    position: absolute;
    top: 20px;
    right: 20px;
    z-index: 1;
}

.dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    position: absolute;
}

.dot:nth-child(1) {
    top: 0;
    right: 0;
}

.dot:nth-child(2) {
    top: 10px;
    right: 10px;
}

.dot:nth-child(3) {
    top: 20px;
    right: 0;
}

.services-cta {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 25px;
    padding: 3rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.12);
    text-align: center;
}

.cta-content h3 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
}

.cta-content p {
    color: var(--text-gray);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
}

.cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.btn-conic {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
    color: white;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(255, 111, 0, 0.18);
}

.btn-conic::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: -100%;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22), transparent);
    transition: left 0.5s;
}

.btn-conic:hover::before {
    left: 100%;
}

.btn-conic:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
}

@keyframes rotate-bg {
    0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
    100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
}

.btn-terminal {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: white;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
}

.btn-terminal:hover {
    background: var(--primary-light);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.3);
}

.terminal-text {
    font-weight: 600;
}

.copy-icon {
    font-size: 1rem;
}

.trust-badges {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.badge {
    background: white;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border: 1px solid rgba(21, 101, 192, 0.12);
}

/* Responsywność */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .services-aura {
        padding: 4rem 1rem;
    }

    .gradient-text {
        font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .services-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .service-card {
        padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .icon-bg {
        width: 60px;
        height: 60px;
    }

    .icon {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .service-content h3 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .cta-buttons {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .trust-badges {
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .badge {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
    }
}

/* Animacje wejścia dla kart */
.service-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
.service-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
.service-card:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
.service-card:nth-child(4) { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
.service-card:nth-child(5) { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
.service-card:nth-child(6) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
</style>